          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Description: Recent testimony (on 30/08/2010) of an old observation (in August 2007, the witness cannot recall the exact date). A witness reports observing, in August 2007 on a beach, a bright object with very vivid color facets behind a commercial airplane. The object is stationary but appears to rotate very slowly on itself. No noise is heard. The observation lasted 2 or 3 minutes before the object disappeared. No other testimony on this phenomenon was collected, for which we lack precision and information.",
